Dialogue: 1,0:59:46.93,0:59:49.42,Cmt-CH,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1449,167)}水\N流\N向\N南\N{\fnFOT-Seurat ProN B\fs56}↓
Dialogue: 1,0:59:46.93,0:59:49.42,Cmt-CH,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1569,192)}长\N良\N川
